  "post_content": "<p>(21 fotos) El teniente de alcalde de Dinamizaci&oacute;n Econ&oacute;mica, &Aacute;ngel Badenas Don&iacute;s, ha presentado este jueves la aplicaci&oacute;n gratuita para m&oacute;viles del Mercado Muncipal de Onda. La APP est&aacute; disponible en los sistemas operativos Android e IOS y &ldquo;es una apuesta m&aacute;s en la modernizaci&oacute;n de esta superficie comercial de proximidad a trav&eacute;s de la utilizaci&oacute;n de las nuevas tecnolog&iacute;as&rdquo;, seg&uacute;n el edil.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4037.jpg\" alt=\"img_4037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4038.jpg\" alt=\"img_4038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4039.jpg\" alt=\"img_4039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4040.jpg\" alt=\"img_4040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4041.jpg\" alt=\"img_4041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4042.jpg\" alt=\"img_4042\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4046.jpg\" alt=\"img_4046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4047.jpg\" alt=\"img_4047\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/appmercatonda/img_4049.jpg\" alt=\"img_4049\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/a